cing)">Scale responsibly across your team</h3></div><div class="mt-1 shrink-0"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-stretch gap-4 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><a class="btn-wipe btn-hover inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-sm/7 font-medium h-9 px-3 py-1 w-full sm:w-auto h-9" style="font-family:var(--btn-font-family);background:var(--btn-bg);border:var(--btn-border);color:var(--btn-text-color);padding:var(--btn-padding);border-radius:var(--btn-radius);text-transform:var(--btn-transform)" href="/enterprise"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">Explore Enterprise<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5" style="display:var(--btn-icon-display)" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><div data-component="Text" class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] max-w-xl text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]" style="font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:var(--body-weight);font-size:var(--body-size);line-height:var(--body-line-height)"><p>Agent infrastructure to automate complex workflows and ship better software. Stay in control with centralized governance, usage visibility, and credit caps.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></section></div><div data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-4;base=%2F"><section data-component="VideoWithStats" class="overflow-hidden lg:relative lg:min-h-[600px]" id="open-source"><div class="relative w-full aspect-square *:size-full *:object-cover lg:absolute lg:inset-0 lg:aspect-auto"><img alt="Warp open-source announcement video poster" loading="lazy" width="2560" height="1440" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="no-frame size-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet=