></span></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block absolute inset-0 bg-black" style="opacity:0.45" aria-hidden="true"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none hidden lg:block absolute z-[5] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 transition-opacity duration-300" style="left:50%;top:50%;opacity:0"><span class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-200 ease-out" style="transform:scale(0.8)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-8 translate-x-[2px]"><path d="M240,128a15.74,15.74,0,0,1-7.6,13.51L88.32,229.65a16,16,0,0,1-16.2.3A15.86,15.86,0,0,1,64,216.13V39.87a15.86,15.86,0,0,1,8.12-13.82,16,16,0,0,1,16.2.3L232.4,114.49A15.74,15.74,0,0,1,240,128Z"></path></svg></span></span><div data-component="Container" class="mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-10 py-10 lg:relative lg:z-10 lg:flex lg:min-h-[600px] lg:items-end lg:py-24" style="max-width:var(--content-max-width)"><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="hidden lg:block"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--space-lg)]"><div class="font-mono text-xs/7 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] lg:!text-white/70" style="font-size:var(--type-xs)">Open-source</div><h2 data-component="Subheading" class="text-pretty text-[var(--color-text)] lg:!text-white" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:var(--heading-weight);font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, var(--type-h2));line-height:var(--lh-snug);letter-spacing:var(--heading-letter-spacing)">Warp Terminal is now open-source</h2><div data-component="Text" class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] text-pretty lg:!text-white/70" style="font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:var(--body-weight);font-size:var(--body-size);line-height:var(--body-line-height)"><p>We&#x27;re excited to build Warp alongside the community using an open-first workflow managed by Oz, our cloud agent orchestration platform.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-3 [&amp;_[data-variant=&#x27;plain&#x27;]]:lg:!text-white [&amp;_[data-variant=&#x27;plain&#x27;]]:lg:hover:!bg-white/15"><button type="button" class="btn-wipe btn-hover inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-sm/7 font-medium h-11 px-4 py-2" style="font-family:var(--btn-font-family);background:var(--btn-bg);border:var(--btn-border);color:var(--btn-text-color);padding:var(--btn-padding);border-radius:var(--btn-radius);text-transform:var(--btn-transform)"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-3.5"><path d="M240,128a15.74,15.74,0,0,1-7.6,13.51L88.32,229.65a16,16,0,0,1-16.2.3A15.86,15.86,0,0,1,64,216.13V39.87a15.86,15.86,0,0,1,8.12-13.82,16,16,0,0,1,16.2.3L232.4,114.49A15.74,15.74,0,0,1,240,128Z"></path></svg>Watch Video<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5" style="display:var(--btn-icon-display)" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-stretch gap-4 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><a class="btn-wipe btn-hover inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-sm/7 font-medium h-11 px-4 py-2 w-full sm:w-auto h-11" style="font-family:var(--btn-font-family);background:var(--btn-bg);border:var(--btn-border);color:var(--btn-text-color);padding:var(--btn-padding);border-radius:var(--btn-radius);text-transform:var(--btn-transform)" data-track-event="cta on page clicked" href="/blog/warp-is-now-open-source"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">Read more<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5" style="display:var(--btn-icon-display)" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-5;base=%2F"><section class="py-[var(--space-section)]" id="testimonials"><div data-component="Container" class="mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-10" style="max-width:var(--content-max-width)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-[var(--space-xl)]"><button type="button" aria-label="Show testimonial 1" class="cursor-pointer transition-opacity duration-300 [&amp;_img]:no-frame [&amp;_img]:h-6 [&amp;_img]:w-auto opacity-100"><span style="filter:invert(1)"><img alt="Microsoft" loading="lazy" width="157" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="no-frame" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F1ygbk6d0%2Fproduction%2F4ae133130b00c054d57732ee4181df3ac4cc402d-157x34.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F1ygbk6d0%2Fproduction%2F4ae133130b00c054d57732ee4181df3ac4cc402d-157x34.svg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F1ygbk6d0%2Fproduction%2F4ae133130b00c054d57732ee4181df3ac4cc402d-157x34.svg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Show testimonial 2" class="cursor-pointer transition-opacity duration-300 [&amp;_img]:no-frame [&amp;_img]:h-6 [&amp;_img]:w-auto opacity-25 hover:opacity-50"><span style="filter:invert(1)"><img alt="OpenAI" loading="lazy" width="123" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="no-frame" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2