></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover/tertiary:translate-x-0 translate-x-[160%]"><path d="M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H69l51.52,51.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17l-72-72a12,12,0,0,1,0-17l72-72a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L69,116H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128Z"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="group/tertiary relative grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-white" style="color:var(--color-background);background-color:var(--color-text)" aria-label="Next testimonial"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-[160%] group-hover/tertiary:translate-x-[160%]"><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover/tertiary:translate-x-0 -translate-x-[160%]"><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="relative mt-12 min-h-[22rem] sm:mt-16 sm:min-h-[26rem] lg:min-h-[30rem]"><figure data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-5.testimonialRefs:page-home-blocks-5-testimonialRefs-0;base=%2F" aria-hidden="false" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-100"><blockquote class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4.5rem)] font-normal leading-[1.06] tracking-tight text-[var(--color-text)] text-pretty *:first:before:content-[&#x27;“&#x27;] *:last:after:content-[&#x27;”&#x27;]"><p>Things that would normally take me 10 minutes instead take just a few seconds to do with Warp.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 text-sm/6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]"><p><strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Marco Casalaina</strong>, <!-- -->VP Products, Core AI and AI Futurist at Microsoft</p><p class="shrink-0 tabular-nums text-[var(--color-muted)]">1<!-- --> / <!-- -->3</p></figcaption></figure><figure data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-5.testimonialRefs:page-home-blocks-5-testimonialRefs-1;base=%2F" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none pointer-events-none opacity-0"><blockquote class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4.5rem)] font-normal leading-[1.06] tracking-tight text-[var(--color-text)] text-pretty *:first:before:content-[&#x27;“&#x27;] *:last:after:content-[&#x27;”&#x27;]"><p>We love how Warp supports builders through the entire software development cycle and are excited to see them continue to push the frontier.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 text-sm/6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]"><p><strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Marc Manara</strong>, <!-- -->Head of Startups at OpenAI</p><p class="shrink-0 tabular-nums text-[var(--color-muted)]">2<!-- --> / <!-- -->3</p></figcaption></figure><figure data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-5.testimonialRefs:page-home-blocks-5-testimonialRefs-2;base=%2F" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none pointer-events-none opacity-0"><blockquote class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4.5rem)] font-normal leading-[1.06] tracking-tight text-[var(--color-text)] text-pretty *:first:before:content-[&#x27;“&#x27;] *:last:after:content-[&#x27;”&#x27;]"><p>Claude Code + Warp is peanut butter and jelly. Warp gracefully manages juggling multiple Claude instances, plus a wide range of other tasks.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 text-sm/6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]"><p><strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Lucas Dickey</strong>, <!-- -->Product at Stripe</p><p class="shrink-0 tabular-nums text-[var(--color-muted)]">3<!-- --> / <!-- -->3</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></section></div><div data-sanity="id=page.home;type=page;path=blocks:page-home-blocks-6;base=%2F"><section data-component="CallToActionWithImage" class="py-[var(--space-section)]" id="home-agent-cta"><div data-component="Container" class="mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-10" style="max-width:var(--content-max-width)"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:gap-[var(--space-section)] flex flex-col items-center text-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--space-xl)] items-center max-w-3xl"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center"><h2 data-component="Subheading" class="text-pretty text-[var(--color-text)] text-center max-w-4xl" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:var(--heading-weight);font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, var(--type-h2));line-height:var(--lh-snug);letter-spacing:var(--heading-letter-spacing)">Start shipping with agents.</h2><div data-component="Text" class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] text-pretty text-center max-w-3xl" style="font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:var(--body-weight);font-size:var(--body-size);line-height:var(--body-line-height)"><p>Download Warp for free, or talk to our team about bringing Warp to your company.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-stretch gap-4 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><a class="btn-wipe btn-hover inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-sm/7 font-medium h-11 px-4 py-2 w-full sm:w-auto h-11" style="font-family:var(--btn-font-family);background:var(--btn-bg);border:var(--btn-border);color:var(--btn-text-color);padding:var(--btn-padding);border-radius:var(--btn-radius);text-transform:var(--btn-transform)" href="/download"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">Download All<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5" style="display:var(--btn-icon-display)" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a><a data-variant="soft" class="link-underline-reveal relative inline-flex shrink-0 self-center items-center gap-1 text-sm/7 font-medium text-[var(--color-text)] w-full sm:w-auto h-11" href="/contact-sales">Contact Sales</a></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><section data-component="DownloadsThreeColumn" class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] py-[var(--space-section)] bg-transparent" id="global-downloads-footer"><div data-component="Container" class="mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-10 flex flex-col gap-10 sm:gap-[var(--space-section)]" style="max-width:var(--content-max-width)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--space-lg)] sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h2 data-component="Subheading" class="text-pretty text-[var(--color-text)]" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:var(--heading-weight);font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, var(--type-h2));line-height:var(--lh-snug);letter-spacing:var(--heading-letter-spacing)">Get Warp today</h2></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 sm:max-w-xs"><div data-component="Text" class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] text-pretty" style="font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:var(--body-weigh